Package: luci-app-xboxaccel
Version: 1.3.0-1
Depends: libc, luci-base, curl, uhttpd, nftables, kmod-nft-nat
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 160
Section: luci
License: Apache-2.0
Maintainer: xboxaccel
Description: Xbox download CDN selector for OpenWrt.
 Keeps separate primary and legacy addresses, suppresses AAAA for those names, and checks dnsmasq before leaving a new record in place.
 International names and xvcf*.xboxlive.cn are answered with an HTTP redirect to a .cn host the node serves instead of being pinned to the CDN address.
 The speed test can measure the real .com 302 path and compare it with .cn without counting the redirect time.
 Connection requests handled by the local 302 are kept in a separate small log.
